{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>秀茂坪今早（12日）發生交通意外，一輛密斗貨車沿寶琳路上斜，右轉入寶達商場時與一輛沿路落斜的九巴相撞。網上流傳事發片段，顯示九巴依綠燈直駛</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130834877110161408794360.png/88_wKxAB3E0vACpzSnAgCEEi_cXdHN2emc_o-JnP6Pg\" alt=\"九巴綠燈時直駛落斜。（網上片段截圖）\"><figcaption>九巴綠燈時直駛落斜。（網上片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>九巴回覆查詢時稱，今晨6時許，九巴一輛路線600巴士駛至寶琳路近寶達邨時，與一輛貨車發生交通事故，巴士上8名乘客及車長受輕傷。九巴已派員慰問傷者。</p><p>調查顯示，巴士當時正遵守綠色交通燈號駛過路口，貨車則在對面行車線衝紅燈右轉。九巴會配合警方調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130834874698305536679431.png/nGtzxdlouDUg6Y_LQok2v_IGxXN3ZUYmFjFoWBYxaFg\" alt=\"貨車與九巴相撞後翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）\"><figcaption>貨車與九巴相撞後翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130834871929933824084659.png/x2lUzjpdxGxYsY6pDDYoZqcL_XJpfEnOXZg7xV2YO8U\" alt=\"貨車撞向九巴車頭後繼而翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）\"><figcaption>貨車撞向九巴車頭後繼而翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130834869035732992162307.png/om_LWDvdRtBnBdxrTp714y4sbtNgcZArwDUjbMA1I2w\" alt=\"貨車撞向九巴車頭後繼而翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）\"><figcaption>貨車撞向九巴車頭後繼而翻側，並旋轉180度調頭。（網上片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130794099733958656098716.jpeg/u6MRO149cUyL8ExnbijecIRKUqUzu1EFxMr71sTK-9Y\" alt=\"貨車翻側後，司機自行爬出車。（小紅書圖片）\"><figcaption>貨車翻側後，司機自行爬出車。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772564608552960408129.jpeg/4bU6IbTHsNlN4jDl7zRAvG2ebG6v4CZ80AgRqtAIEao\" alt=\"10名傷者在場等候治理。\"><figcaption>10名傷者在場等候治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772573366521856107246.jpeg/cmgdn69ruhwIcXzPLvaay1h1yRg4MHNd6-GWc-vhlnM\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772577506430976041762.jpeg/I31ttEBXQLL4rLLVZ-coUMflNa6AxBWIk_UW2ZP1Ftk\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772581461790720164075.jpeg/OwN94zIe1mi0-ZdhaWVMFVYOq5VR9JMNTBRfi0wUX4s\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772545323143168083762.jpeg/YY-iVK5NogrtIBziuUTktWvwb29uqcDcfy9NcH8vTXA\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772549504995328461753.jpeg/oSSCQlcQ0bVzdA0-eGAnQ0VV6cHhKdcZM9ZHgjPWR4I\" alt=\"巴士車頭盡毀。\"><figcaption>巴士車頭盡毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130794177718652928053971.jpeg/weKh84oiHDB6PbKFalBAilD-VBTwL6MFzMGU0czBlNE\" alt=\"九巴撞車後，乘客自行離開車廂。（小紅書圖片）\"><figcaption>九巴撞車後，乘客自行離開車廂。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:21.268978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":425,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}